<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Game mode, for the Quick Settings tile.

  Six dots again — the same count as the app's mark and the notification icon,
  because a seventh logo for one app is how an app stops looking like one thing.
  Here they are arranged as a controller rather than a hexagon: four as the
  d-pad, two as the buttons. Untinted black so a tile or a ColorFilter can put
  it in whichever ink is wanted.
-->
